  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multi-year support to World Food Program emergency response</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve access to food to vulnerable and disaster affected populations through food aid and nutrition support. This will benefit 3.24 million acutely food insecure people, 215,000 malnourished under 5 children and 58,000 pregnant and lactating women by preventing them from hunger and malnutrition. This contributes to our MDG&#x2019;s by preventing loss of lives and livelihoods in emergencies and will results in reduction of national rate of acute malnutrition from 9.7% to 7% by the end of 2015</narrative>
  </description>
